WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:02.627
MARC MARON: I don't wanna
 be negative, but...

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:04.003
I don't think anything's
ever gonna get better

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.380
ever again.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.841
♪ (ROCK MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:09.926
And don't misunderstand me,
I have no hope.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.929
I think if you have hope,
what are you, fucking seven?

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:15.682
Like, if you really think

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.892
a flying Jew
is gonna come back

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.811
and make everything okay,

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.313
isn't that, like,
mental illness?

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.151
You think you're
a better man than me

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.652
'cause you have human kids?

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:29.696
I have three cats
that I love.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.531
And in the best case
scenario,

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.324
I'm gonna have to
have them all killed.

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.535
I'm gonna have to kill
my friends.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.997
And I knew it going in,
that's how big my heart is.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.792
Let me get serious.
I know a lot of you know

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.711
that during COVID,
my girlfriend passed away.

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:46.880
She did. Passed away, and it
was the most horrible thing

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:49.174
that's ever happened to me,
and I'm sure to her.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.176
The truth is, like,

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.761
I'm a guy who talks
about his life.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:55.263
So, I wasn't clear
how that was gonna go,

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.681
how am I gonna talk
about that?

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.099
But then I thought, "Well,
maybe, how about a TED Talk?"

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:00.643
I just have to change
my posture a little bit.

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:02.228
Everyone dies.

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.230
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:07.108
I'm gonna die.
You're gonna die.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:08.693
We all die.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:12.572
I'm Marc Maron.
I'm a comedian.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:14.574
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS, CLAPS)

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.451
♪ (ELECTRIC GUITAR PLAYS) ♪

